    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "根据2023年9月20日FOMC声明，委员会决定维持联邦基金利率目标区间在5-1/4至5-1/2个百分点（即5.25%–5.50%），本次决定为维持而非调整。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 675,
              "character_end": 778
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "the Committee decided to maintain the\ntarget range for the federal funds rate at 5-1/4 to 5-1/2 percent"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support",
        "rate_unit_warnings": [
          {
            "claimed_text": "联邦基金利率目标区间在5-1/4至5-1/2个百分点",
            "status": "requires_review"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后续政策若进一步收紧，委员会将考虑的因素包括：货币政策的累积收紧程度、货币政策影响经济活动和通胀的滞后性、以及经济和金融形势的发展。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 1006,
              "character_end": 1205
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "the\nCommittee will take into account the cumulative tightening of monetary policy, the lags with\nwhich monetary policy affects economic activity and inflation, and economic and financial\ndevelopments"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "在评估货币政策立场时，委员会将考虑广泛的信息，包括劳动力市场状况、通胀压力和通胀预期、以及金融和国际形势发展，并准备在目标达成需要时调整货币政策立场。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 1908,
              "character_end": 2037
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "readings on labor market conditions,\ninflation pressures and inflation expectations, and financial and international developments"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "incomplete",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "声明文本为部分摘录，第二页末尾文字中断，后续完整表述未包含在所提供的来源中。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 1645,
              "character_end": 1665
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The Committee\n(more)"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "尽管本次维持利率不变，声明强调委员会仍高度关注通胀风险，并强烈承诺将通胀回归2%目标，暗示未来仍可能进一步收紧，不能解读为紧缩周期结束。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 479,
              "character_end": 537
            },
            "quotation_match": "exact",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The Committee remains highly attentive to inflation risks."
          },
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 883,
              "character_end": 1004
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "In determining the extent\nof additional policy firming that may be appropriate to return inflation to 2 percent over time"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "counterargument"
      },
      {
        "text": "声明同时指出信贷条件收紧可能拖累经济、就业和通胀，这构成与继续加息相反的另一面考量。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 311,
              "character_end": 431
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "Tighter credit conditions for households\nand businesses are likely to weigh on economic activity, hiring, and inflation."
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "counterargument"
      }
